// Role: the targeted sweep of the strict second reading: every confirmed field of the fill review whose quote is under
//   60 characters or names no relation (scripts/strict.mjs, sweepSelection), read again under the strict rule because the
//   blind sample found the review's confirmed grades flip at more than 5%.
// Contract: exports SWEEP = { why, selection, through, grades: { "id.field": { verdict, quotes, reason, keep? } } }. keep: the
//   grade cites the review's own receipts for the part they state (resolved by scripts/strict.mjs); otherwise quotes are
//   given as in audit/strict/reading-0_2.js. through names the last review entry the sweep has reached, in review order
//   (it is committed in parts). Fields already read in the blind sample are not graded again here.
// Invariant: data only; a second reading beside the review's grade, never an edit to it. Not blind: the sweep reads the
//   review's quotes and notes.
